-------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Not included: model weights and the unblur networks
-------------------------------------------------------------------------------

PAINITE ships no model weights. `painite-server models pull` downloads each
model from its upstream source after the server operator accepts that model's
license (shown by `painite-server models list`). The unblur networks'
source code (Stripformer: non-commercial license; LaKDNet: AGPL-3.0) is
downloaded the same way and is not part of PAINITE or covered by its license.
Some model licenses forbid commercial use; check them before you use PAINITE
commercially. server/third_party/ holds reference copies used only by the
tests, under their own licenses.
